    "body": "The bogus doctype state also doesn't report an error for nulls. Maybe it's because there's a parse error already for entering those states, it's not so necessary to scan for further errors. But since we removed U+0000 as a parse error in the input stream preprocessing, there could be a point in checking for null in these states.",
